        "can bring a ball."
      ],
      "audioText": "She also asks if you can bring a ball.",
      "audioMode": "tts",
      "languageCode": "en",
      "patternId": "n4-messages-and-gossip-5"
    },
    {
      "id": "en.n4.class-35.t04",
      "en": "Carlos told us to arrive early.",
      "es": "Carlos nos dijo que llegáramos temprano.",
      "explanationEs": "Una orden pasada sigue el modelo de told + persona + to + verbo.",
      "segments": [
        "Carlos told us",
        "to arrive early."
      ],
      "audioText": "Carlos told us to arrive early.",
      "audioMode": "tts",
      "languageCode": "en",
      "patternId": "n4-messages-and-gossip-5"
    },
    {
      "id": "en.n4.class-35.t05",
      "en": "You missed the message, so I will tell you the main points.",
      "es": "No escuchaste el mensaje, así que te contaré los puntos principales.",
      "explanationEs": "Main points = los datos principales: qué, cuándo y dónde.",
      "segments": [
        "You missed the message, so I",
        "will tell you the main points."
      ],
      "audioText": "You missed the message, so I will tell you the main points.",
      "audioMode": "tts",
